  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership with KEITI (Phase II) for GCF project development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is to change the project code and transfer the project from Asia Regional Office to Africa Regional Office, as a GCF concept note for Mozambique has been finally selected for support. &#x2022; The proposed project is a follow up initiative to ROA19 - Partnership with KEITI for GCF project concept scoping conducted/completed in 2022.&#x2022; GGGI will work with KEITI to take GGGI&#x2019;s existing GCF concept note(s) forward to the next stage (e.g. F/S, PPF application, or full proposal) with KEITI&apos;s project preparation grant under KEITI&#x2019;s &quot;GCF project development support program&quot;.&#x2022;  GGGI will contract qualified Korean firms (consortium) selected through competitive process. GGGI will be responsible for government/local stakeholder engagement, identification of suitable AE, potential co-financiers, and subsequent engagement, and overall quality control of the proposal development, while selected Korean firms will be responsible for technical assessment.</narrative>
  </description>
